### Editing a file in place.

edit-select-a-file = Select a file in the worktree to edit it.
edit-loading = Loading…

## Why a file cannot be edited here.

edit-too-large = This file is too large to edit here.
edit-not-text = This is not a text file.
edit-not-utf8 = This file is not UTF-8 text; saving it from here would damage it.
edit-not-in-worktree = This file is not in the worktree (deleted, or a folder or link).
